# Local test-build scratch (Smart App Control workaround — see run-tests.sh)
.gotmp/
# Issued certs / CA material — never commit.
# ANCHORED (leading slash) on purpose: these mean the component-root runtime dirs ONLY.
# Unanchored `certs/` also matched `internal/certs/` — the Go SOURCE package — which silently
# kept it out of every clean checkout and broke `go build` in CI and in the release image.
/data/
/certs/
*.pem
*.crt
*.key
